PecoFence — Apache License 2.0
================================================================================

The desktop-fence subsystem of Renown (source files under
`src-tauri/src/fence/`) is a Rust port of PecoFence's fence model, rule engine,
desktop enumeration, shell icon extraction, monitor fingerprinting and Win32
window-layer logic.

